<node id="[PERSON] Bovino">
  <data key="d0">[PERSON] Bovino</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Bovino is a former Border Patrol commander at large who appears in footage from Minneapolis and Chicago, where he was seen with Hewson and identified as being near EZ-17. He is also described as accompanying EZ-17 and EZ-2 on raids in Minnesota and as being alongside EZ-17 at an incident in Illinois. These descriptions place him in multiple force-related incidents in Minneapolis, Chicago, and Illinois.

Bovino is further described as having instigated confrontations and later stating in an Illinois deposition that he did not believe those actions constituted a use-of-force incident. In connection with one event, he was said to have thrown a tear gas canister after being hit on the head and struck by objects thrown by protesters. He was also ordered by Judge Ellis to turn over use-of-force reports and body camera footage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-48865492ff6980fba6505562f4fd8f89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48ffeb8cda0384416cef68fda1fa6092&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5569f17f529fd10346ca691a582f1a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a6774ff001e7c0d324470176c02f568&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d313e963f5afd4511121b3011aa2c20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-791d993b170dda54c1f646cc730be410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1033809decf9ea155de9688c644d3c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7672b3b47339e0fa256bbc603183e57b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c6946cf77d89e363da36211d90f9912</data>
