<node id="[PERSON] Renee Good">
  <data key="d0">[PERSON] Renee Good</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Renee Good was a U.S. citizen who was shot and killed in Minneapolis by an Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE) officer or agent. The descriptions consistently indicate that the death occurred in early 2026 and that ICE was directly involved in the shooting. Some accounts specify that the killing was carried out by an ICE officer, while others refer more generally to ICE agents, but they all describe the same incident in Minneapolis.

Renee Good’s death was reported as having preceded subsequent protests, suggesting that the killing became a notable public event. The available descriptions do not provide additional personal details beyond identifying Renee Good as a U.S. citizen and the victim of a fatal shooting by ICE in Minneapolis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-48865492ff6980fba6505562f4fd8f89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebcdfff30be940995bf3bcfa689a2bdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48ffeb8cda0384416cef68fda1fa6092&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144039d9b499b5a1b6464126b5c11ea1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4170a826ce256ee580815639136542ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb8aeb870066721a39cb33b3cacee828&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddda38fff0b28618245a95601266bd62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af8c6d503e4007ddea82e86657430f46</data>
