<node id="[LOCATION] Minneapolis">
  <data key="d0">[LOCATION] Minneapolis</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Minneapolis is the city associated with multiple incidents described in the source material, serving as the location for several confrontations, use-of-force events, killings, and related protest activity. It is identified as the setting for the Target store confrontation and footage taken on Nicollet Avenue, as well as incidents involving Hewson and Bovino and other situations in which agents were seen.

Minneapolis is also described as the city where protest-related violence and fatalities occurred, including a fatal shooting and the protests that followed. The descriptions further place some of the most intense protests there and note that the city was named in the article title covering the incident. The references indicate that Minneapolis was the location of use-of-force incidents in 2025 and of early 2026 use-of-force incidents and killings as well.&lt;SEP&gt;City where Renee Good was shot and where protests followed.&lt;SEP&gt;City where Renee Good was shot.&lt;SEP&gt;City where the shooting and subsequent protest occurred.&lt;SEP&gt;City where Bryant Square Park is located.&lt;SEP&gt;City associated with Bryant Square Park and a noteworthy firing incident.&lt;SEP&gt;City associated with multiple incidents and protest activity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-48865492ff6980fba6505562f4fd8f89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d17e0f591005ffb59a7f371310e5a906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebcdfff30be940995bf3bcfa689a2bdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48ffeb8cda0384416cef68fda1fa6092&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144039d9b499b5a1b6464126b5c11ea1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4170a826ce256ee580815639136542ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fef9d4f066439678dcf9e73935433d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9817d6c2a44499a793919afdc362415&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c623b1d6b3fdbe8556f7ed5defe698b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-430166eda1140532dd1c88ca903c35b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb8aeb870066721a39cb33b3cacee828&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddda38fff0b28618245a95601266bd62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af8c6d503e4007ddea82e86657430f46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3fbf4484a5c27ccd7d2dc07a14cd7d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b404c27fcd418c08782247364738a7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d8292ecd6d23098f17a3015d86836d6</data>
