  <data key="d2">CalMatters is a news organization and reporting partner involved in an investigation and publication effort. It is identified as the organization whose reporter contacted Vazquez and Sveum, and whose reporter was mentioned in that context. CalMatters also emailed and called Donahue before publication, reflecting its role in attempting to reach named individuals prior to publication.

In addition, CalMatters served as a partner organization in the analysis of footage and records and as a reporting partner on the investigation. The descriptions collectively indicate that CalMatters participated directly in investigative reporting, including outreach to sources and collaboration in analyzing evidence before publication.</data>
