<node id="[PERSON] protesters">
  <data key="d0">[PERSON] protesters</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Protesters are individuals or groups participating in protest activity who, in the described incidents, were involved in clashes, attempted blockades, and confrontations with agents or other individuals. They were referenced as being present at the Broadview ICE processing center, where they took part in efforts to block access and were involved in broader protest actions.

Across the accounts, protesters were described as shouting at agents, throwing objects, and in some cases filming the encounter. They were also described as blocking or obstructing vehicles and telling people to get out of the street, with some allegedly throwing objects such as snowballs at vehicles. In one incident, protesters physically blocked a truck and were pushed out of the way by EZ-17 and EZ-2, while in another, unidentified protesters allegedly threw objects at Bovino and were threatened with arrest by agents.

The descriptions also emphasize that protesters were repeatedly subjected to force and crowd-control measures. They were targeted with tear gas, chemical agents, pepper spray threats, guns, violent force, and less-lethal munitions, and were also mentioned in connection with dispersal actions, arrest threats, and launcher fire. One account notes unidentified protesters confronted by Donahue in a Chicago suburb and were threatened with a gun. Overall, protesters are portrayed as the people or groups at the center of these confrontations, both as participants in protest actions and as targets of enforcement responses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-48865492ff6980fba6505562f4fd8f89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebcdfff30be940995bf3bcfa689a2bdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48ffeb8cda0384416cef68fda1fa6092&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-707f7c6c308b38bce8ce1972afbd8ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144039d9b499b5a1b6464126b5c11ea1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5569f17f529fd10346ca691a582f1a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a6774ff001e7c0d324470176c02f568&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d313e963f5afd4511121b3011aa2c20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-791d993b170dda54c1f646cc730be410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9817d6c2a44499a793919afdc362415&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c623b1d6b3fdbe8556f7ed5defe698b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49b4df5b01d976649250f6436e21c973&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1033809decf9ea155de9688c644d3c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63051b407620cc9dc179a3eb02bac5dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7672b3b47339e0fa256bbc603183e57b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd5847b97b78096be5085730e8050c4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c6946cf77d89e363da36211d90f9912&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb8aeb870066721a39cb33b3cacee828</data>
