<node id="[ORGANIZATION] Border Patrol">
  <data key="d0">[ORGANIZATION] Border Patrol</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Border Patrol is a federal agency and a component of the U.S. Department of Homeland Security (DHS). In the provided descriptions, Border Patrol agents are documented across multiple cities and are the agency’s personnel referenced in the evidence.

The descriptions associate Border Patrol with several specific incidents. Its agents were reportedly involved in a fatal incident and in clashes with protesters, including the protests that followed Good’s death. They are also referenced in relation to EZ-17 and EZ-2. In one account, Border Patrol agents arrested Isabel Mata and were reportedly involved in other arrests as well.

Separately, Border Patrol is described as the agency whose agents pulled over Campos and a passenger, threatened them, allegedly slashed their tyres, and arrested them.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d17e0f591005ffb59a7f371310e5a906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebcdfff30be940995bf3bcfa689a2bdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144039d9b499b5a1b6464126b5c11ea1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5569f17f529fd10346ca691a582f1a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9817d6c2a44499a793919afdc362415&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1033809decf9ea155de9688c644d3c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-231d778102a2cbcc7f2f4300f5629d66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abacff6e2984923123c9fdcc9f5afcb1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af8c6d503e4007ddea82e86657430f46</data>
