<node id="[ORGANIZATION] Bellingcat">
  <data key="d0">[ORGANIZATION] Bellingcat</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Bellingcat is a non-profit investigative news organization and publication that served as a reporting and analytical partner in the described investigations. It participated in the investigation and publication of reported material by reviewing footage, court documents, incident reports, and a social media account, and it is characterized as both an investigative outlet and a source that analyzed and verified evidence used in the reporting.

Across the descriptions, Bellingcat is consistently presented as an investigative journalism and news-analysis organization that reviewed videos, analyzed incidents, and requested or performed expert review. It examined social media videos, verified events in Illinois, reviewed court records, and in one case reported that it did not hear a threat in the video. It also reviewed footage but was unable to verify that the spray shown was pepper spray.

Bellingcat also previously reported on EZ-17 and EZ-2 and corroborated the identifications of Vazquez and Sveum. In another analysis, it identified the B&amp;T GL-06 40mm launcher in a video. Overall, Bellingcat is described as the investigative outlet that produced the analysis and collaborated on the article while verifying and contextualizing video and documentary evidence.&lt;SEP&gt;Outlet that asked DHS about internal policy and training.&lt;SEP&gt;Investigative outlet that reported on DHS incidents and requested use-of-force policies.&lt;SEP&gt;Organization that reviewed footage of multiple incidents involving federal agents carrying or using the B&amp;T GL06 launcher.&lt;SEP&gt;Reporting organisation.&lt;SEP&gt;Organization conducting the investigation of DHS incidents.&lt;SEP&gt;Investigative publication referenced by the page URL, newsletter, WhatsApp channel, support, and image credit.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d17e0f591005ffb59a7f371310e5a906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebcdfff30be940995bf3bcfa689a2bdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48ffeb8cda0384416cef68fda1fa6092&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-707f7c6c308b38bce8ce1972afbd8ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144039d9b499b5a1b6464126b5c11ea1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4170a826ce256ee580815639136542ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5569f17f529fd10346ca691a582f1a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b93e00a9cc3c6ea937c6c587abe580f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fef9d4f066439678dcf9e73935433d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e32f71ea37f2011ffa9c3166235ce93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-231d778102a2cbcc7f2f4300f5629d66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c836f96bf9d6ee01706c399b410c87c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63051b407620cc9dc179a3eb02bac5dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a823d8c0102b14d5a5e7a1db6951caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd5847b97b78096be5085730e8050c4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c6946cf77d89e363da36211d90f9912&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-405d3a718f7ecf6421ab9b20b50849aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7672b3b47339e0fa256bbc603183e57b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb8aeb870066721a39cb33b3cacee828&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddda38fff0b28618245a95601266bd62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-825d31ce533f64fd232a2407d882af7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a07ab4e361aefef70c10056e05aad7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abacff6e2984923123c9fdcc9f5afcb1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af8c6d503e4007ddea82e86657430f46</data>
