<node id="[LOCATION] Illinois">
  <data key="d0">[LOCATION] Illinois</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Illinois is the U.S. state referenced across the provided descriptions as the location connected to a series of federal law-enforcement and court-related events. It is identified as the state where federal judge Sara Ellis issued an opinion in November, as well as the state where she sat when the restraining order was issued.

Illinois is also described as the state where EZ-17 was spotted alongside Bovino during an incident, and the state where the injunction limiting federal agents’ use of force was ordered. In addition, Illinois is the state referenced in connection with an ICE operation and DHS remarks, including the verified events and Operation Midway Blitz. The descriptions further indicate that dataset incidents were verified to have taken place in Illinois.&lt;SEP&gt;State associated with the judge who issued the TRO.&lt;SEP&gt;State where a judge issued a temporary restraining order.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ebcdfff30be940995bf3bcfa689a2bdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144039d9b499b5a1b6464126b5c11ea1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4170a826ce256ee580815639136542ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a6774ff001e7c0d324470176c02f568&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d313e963f5afd4511121b3011aa2c20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9817d6c2a44499a793919afdc362415&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c623b1d6b3fdbe8556f7ed5defe698b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0256a8b75cb8334fe03b715b6c84c437&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c836f96bf9d6ee01706c399b410c87c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a823d8c0102b14d5a5e7a1db6951caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-405d3a718f7ecf6421ab9b20b50849aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddda38fff0b28618245a95601266bd62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af8c6d503e4007ddea82e86657430f46</data>
