<node id="[ORGANIZATION] CBP">
  <data key="d0">[ORGANIZATION] CBP</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">CBP refers to U.S. Customs and Border Protection, the U.S. federal agency responsible for customs and border enforcement. In the provided descriptions, CBP is consistently identified as the agency involved in enforcement activity, incident reports, and policy discussions, including references to Judge Ellis’ ruling, DHS’s claim about policy compliance, and a 2021 DHS Office of Inspector General report.

CBP is also described as the source of the January 2021 Use of Force Policy, including restrictions on compressed air launchers and related training recertification requirements. The descriptions further connect CBP to BORTAC, including BORTAC’s selection process and related text discussing the unit. Additional references include operational mentions such as a CBP agent, an unmarked white CBP truck, and CBP agents being targets of thrown snowballs. One description uses the variant wording “Customs and Border Patrol,” but the overall references clearly indicate U.S. Customs and Border Protection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-48ffeb8cda0384416cef68fda1fa6092&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-707f7c6c308b38bce8ce1972afbd8ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4170a826ce256ee580815639136542ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b93e00a9cc3c6ea937c6c587abe580f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fef9d4f066439678dcf9e73935433d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d313e963f5afd4511121b3011aa2c20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-791d993b170dda54c1f646cc730be410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9817d6c2a44499a793919afdc362415&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-430166eda1140532dd1c88ca903c35b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63051b407620cc9dc179a3eb02bac5dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c6946cf77d89e363da36211d90f9912&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7672b3b47339e0fa256bbc603183e57b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-601d339a4a493a5f03ee5c3181e3905b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb8aeb870066721a39cb33b3cacee828&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d9eac605e9363cf2b25e5d8a6f2fc3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-825d31ce533f64fd232a2407d882af7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f012afbc78a585fbfae845130e83a796&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3af2defb9bc456081d4547c62ac2dbcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abacff6e2984923123c9fdcc9f5afcb1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af8c6d503e4007ddea82e86657430f46</data>
