<node id="[ORGANIZATION] Defense Technology">
  <data key="d0">[ORGANIZATION] Defense Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Defense Technology is a manufacturer and producer of less-lethal munitions, sprays, and related tactical products. It is identified as the manufacturer of the 40mm SKAT Shell and the 40mm Direct Impact Rounds, and it is also referenced in connection with 40mm less-lethal munitions more generally. In addition, Defense Technology is cited as a manufacturer of smoke grenades, shells, and sprays, with its products and technical specifications used as reference material for these items.

Defense Technology is also associated with law enforcement and civilian spray products. Its technical specifications are noted as recommending minimum deployment distances for sprays, and it is referenced in connection with grenade and spray color-band conventions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5fef9d4f066439678dcf9e73935433d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9817d6c2a44499a793919afdc362415&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb8aeb870066721a39cb33b3cacee828&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d9eac605e9363cf2b25e5d8a6f2fc3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-825d31ce533f64fd232a2407d882af7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f012afbc78a585fbfae845130e83a796&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3af2defb9bc456081d4547c62ac2dbcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abacff6e2984923123c9fdcc9f5afcb1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af8c6d503e4007ddea82e86657430f46</data>
